@model TMSWeb.Models.Entities.LOG.TblJobMaster
@using (Html.BeginForm("AddOcean", "Order", FormMethod.Post, new { id = "frmAddOcean", onsubmit = "return OnValidateOcean()" }))
{
    @Html.HiddenFor(m => m.JobCode)
    @Html.HiddenFor(m => m.CustomerCode, new { id = "txtOceanCustomerCode" })
    @Html.Hidden("oceanacronym")
    <div class="form-body">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-7">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-sm-4">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label>
                                ค้นหาลูกค้า
                                <span class="required"> * </span>
                            </label>
                            <div class="input-group input-group-sm">
                                @Html.TextBoxFor(m => m.CostCode, new
                                {
                                    @Class = "form-control customer-cost",
                                    id =
                                "txtOceanCostCode",
                                    autocomplete = "off"
                                })
                                <span class="input-group-btn">
                                    <button class="btn red" type="button"
                                            onclick="searchCustomerFunc('ocean')">
                                        ค้นหา
                                    </button>
                                </span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="help-block"></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-8">
                        <label>ชื่อลูกค้า</label>
                        @Html.TextBox("txtOceanCustomerName", null, new
                        {
                            @Class = "form-control input-sm",
                            disabled =
                        "Disabled"
                        })
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label>รหัสสถานที่รับตู้</label>
                            <span class="required"> * </span>
                            <div class="input-group input-group-sm">
                                @Html.TextBox("txtOceanStartCode", null, new
                                {
                                    @Class = "form-control",
                                    autocomplete = "off"
                                })
                                <span class="input-group-btn">
                                    <button class="btn red" type="button" onclick="searchPlaceFunc('S')">ค้นหา</button>
                                </span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="help-block help-group"></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-5">
                        <label>ชื่อสถานที่รับตู้</label>
                        @Html.TextBox("txtOceanDisStartName", null, new
                        {
                            @Class = "form-control input-sm",
                            disabled =
                        "Disabled"
                        })
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-3">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label> </label>
                            <div class="mt-checkbox-list" style="padding-bottom:0!important;">
                                <label class="mt-checkbox mt-checkbox-outline font-sm">
                                    ค่าผ่านลาน/ท่า
                                    <input type="checkbox" value="TRUE" name="chkStartPortYard" checked />
                                    <span></span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label>สถานที่คืนตู้</label>
                            <div class="input-group input-group-sm">
                                @Html.TextBox("txtOceanFinishCode", null, new
                                {
                                    @Class = "form-control",
                                    autocomplete =
                                "off"
                                })
                                <span class="input-group-btn">
                                    <button class="btn red" type="button" onclick="searchPlaceFunc('F')">ค้นหา</button>
                                </span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="help-block help-group"></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-5">
                        <label>ชื่อสถานที่คืนตู้</label>
                        @Html.TextBox("txtOceanDisFinishName", null, new
                        {
                            @Class = "form-control input-sm",
                            disabled =
                        "Disabled"
                        })
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-md-3">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label> </label>
                            <div class="mt-checkbox-list">
                                <label class="mt-checkbox mt-checkbox-outline" style="font-size:13px!important">
                                    ค่าผ่านลาน/ท่า
                                    <input type="checkbox" value="TRUE" name="chkFinishPortYard" checked />
                                    <span></span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-9">
                        <label>ชื่อสถานที่เปิด/บรรจุ/ลงท่า</label>
                        @Html.Hidden("txtOceanMissionCode", null, new { @Class = "form-control", autocomplete = "off" })
                        @Html.TextBox("txtOceanDisMissionName", null, new
                        {
                            @Class = "form-control input-sm",
                            disabled =
                        "Disabled"
                        })
                    </div>
                </div>
                <br />
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-9">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label>
                                Place
                                <span class="required"> * </span>
                            </label>
                            @Html.TextBox("place_code", null, new { @Class = "input-sm form-control", id = "place", autocomplete = "off" })
                            <span class="help-block"></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-9">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>
                                    Consignee Name
                                    <span class="required"> * </span>
                                </label>
                                <br />
                                @Html.DropDownList("consignee_name", null, "-----เลือก-----", new
                                {
                                    @Class = "form-control input-sm",
                                    id = "consignee_name"
                                })
                                <span class="help-block help-filter"></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-9">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>
                                    เลขที่ใบขน
                                    <span class="required"> * </span>
                                </label>
                                @Html.TextBox("goods_declaration", null, new { @Class = "form-control input-sm", autocomplete = "off" })
                                <span class="help-block"></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-5">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>
                                    Shipper Name
                                    <span class="required"> * </span>
                                </label>
                                <br />
                                @Html.DropDownList("shipper_name", null, "-----เลือก-----", new { @Class = "form-control input-sm", id = "shipper_name" })
                                <span class="help-block help-filter"></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>
                                    Shipping Contact
                                    <span class="required"> * </span>
                                </label>
                                <br />
                                @Html.DropDownList("shipping_name", null, "-----เลือก-----", new { @Class = "form-control input-sm", id = "shipping_name" })
                                <span class="help-block help-filter"></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>
                                    Request By
                                    <span class="required"> * </span>
                                </label>
                                <br />
                                @Html.DropDownList("request_name", null, "-----เลือก-----", new { @Class = "form-control input-sm", id = "request_name" })
                                <span class="help-block help-filter"></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label>
                                Incoterm
                                <span class="required"> * </span>
                            </label>
                            @Html.TextBoxFor(m => m.JobIncoterm, new { @Class = "form-control input-sm", autocomplete = "off" })
                            <span class="help-block"></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label>
                                Dossier/Invoice
                                <span class="required"> * </span>
                            </label>
                            @Html.TextBoxFor(m => m.JobInvoice, new
                            {
                                @Class = "form-control input-sm",
                                autocomplete = "off"
                            })
                            <span class="help-block"></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label>
                                Description
                                <span class="required"> * </span>
                            </label>
                            @Html.TextBox("description", null, new { @Class = "input-sm form-control", id = "description", autocomplete = "off" })
                            <span class="help-block"></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label>
                                B/L Change No.
                                <span class="required"> * </span>
                            </label>
                            @Html.TextBox("change_no", null, new { @Class = "form-control input-sm", autocomplete = "off" })
                            <span class="help-block"></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label>
                                VESSEL
                                <span class="required"> * </span>
                            </label>
                            @Html.TextBox("vessel", null, new { @Class = "form-control input-sm", autocomplete = "off" })
                            <span class="help-block"></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label>
                                ETA (วันเรือเข้า)
                                <span class="required"> * </span>
                            </label>
                            @Html.TextBox("eta_date", null, new
                            {
                                @Class = "form-control input-sm datepicker",
                                autocomplete
                            = "off"
                            })
                            <span class="help-block"></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label>
                                Pick Up Date
                                <span class="required"> * </span>
                            </label>
                            @Html.TextBox("pickup_date", null, new
                            {
                                @Class = "datetimepicker input-sm form-control",
                                autocomplete = "off"
                            })
                            <span class="help-block"></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label>
                                ขนาดตู้
                                <span class="required"> * </span>
                            </label>
                            <br />
                            @Html.DropDownList("ContainerSizeCode", null, "-----เลือก-----", new { @Class = "form-control input-sm", id = "ocean_container_kind" })
                            <span class="help-block help-filter"></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-12">
                                <label>อื่น ๆ ระบุ</label>
                                @Html.TextBox("txtOther", null, new
                                {
                                    @Class = "form-control input-sm",
                                    id =
                                "txtOceanOther",
                                    Disabled =
                                "Disabled",
                                    autocomplete = "off"
                                })
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label>
                                จำนวนรถ
                                <span class="required"> * </span>
                            </label>
                            @Html.TextBoxFor(m => m.ContainerAmount, new
                            {
                                @Class = "form-control input-sm form-number",
                                id
                            = "txtOceanAmount",
                                autocomplete = "off"
                            })
                            <span class="help-block"></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label>
                                ประเภทรถ
                                <span class="required"> * </span>
                            </label>
                            @Html.DropDownList("TruckTypegroupCode", null, "-----เลือก-----", new { @Class = "form-control input-sm", id = "ocean_truck_type" })
                            <span class="help-block"></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label>
                                ค่าทางด่วน
                            </label>
                            @Html.TextBox("expressway", null, new
                            {
                                @Class = "form-control input-sm",
                                id =
                            "txtOceanExpressway",
                                autocomplete = "off"
                            })
                            <span class="help-block"></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class=" col-md-12">
                <table class="table">
                    <tbody id="ocean-detail">
                        <tr>
                            <td style="vertical-align:middle;text-align:center;">
                                <a href="javascript:;" class="font-blue" onclick="addDetail()">
                                    <i class="fal fa-plus-circle"></i>
                                </a>
                            </td>
                            <td>
                                @Html.TextBox("iBL[]", null, new
                                {
                                    @Class = "form-control input-sm",
                                    Placeholder = "B/L No",
                                    autocomplete = "off"
                                })
                            </td>
                            <td>
                                @Html.TextBox("iContainer[]", null, new
                                {
                                    @Class = "form-control input-sm",
                                    Placeholder = "เบอร์ตู้",
                                    autocomplete = "off"
                                })
                            </td>
                            <td>
                                @Html.TextBox("iQuantity[]", null, new
                                {
                                    @Class = "form-control input-sm",
                                    Placeholder = "จำนวน",
                                    autocomplete = "off"
                                })
                            </td>
                            <td>
                                @Html.TextBox("iWeight[]", null, new
                                {
                                    @Class = "form-control input-sm",
                                    Placeholder = "น้ำหนัก",
                                    autocomplete = "off"
                                })
                            </td>
                            <td>
                                @Html.TextBox("iCBM[]", null, new
                                {
                                    @Class = "form-control input-sm",
                                    Placeholder = "ปริมาตร",
                                    autocomplete = "off"
                                })
                            </td>
                            <td>
                                @Html.TextBox("iDelivery[]", null, new
                                {
                                    @Class = "form-control input-sm datetimepicker",
                                    Placeholder = "วันที่ส่งสินค้า",
                                    autocomplete = "off"
                                })
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-12">
                <label>หมายเหตุ</label>
                @Html.TextBoxFor(m => m.JobRemark, new { @Class = "form-control input-sm", rows = "3", autocomplete = "off" })
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-actions">
        <div class="row pull-right">
            <div class="col-md-12">
                <div class="tools-action">
                    <a href="/order/">กลับหน้าหลัก</a> |
                    <button type="submit" class="btn green">บันทึกข้อมูล</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
}